Package: Mescnet
Type: Package
Title: Maximum-Entropy Single-Cell Gene Network Construction, Visualization
    and Benchmarking
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Fanglabyaominghui",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "429470425@qq.com")
Description: Constructs context-specific gene programs from single-cell and
    spatial transcriptomics data. Cells are aggregated into local metacells to
    reduce expression sparsity, gene-gene relationships are estimated from both
    marginal correlation and partial correlation, the two signals are combined
    into a 'BayesCor' score, the association matrix is soft-thresholded into a
    weighted network, and gene communities are detected with the Leiden
    algorithm. The package also provides Seurat v5 compatible replacements for
    hdWGCNA metacell and metaspot aggregation, and utilities for benchmarking
    reconstructed networks against reference networks with EGAD. Plotting
    helpers cover UMAPs, UCell module scores, kME-scaled co-expression network
    views and hub-gene heat maps, and the repository includes a runnable PBMC
    case study.
